## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen3.5-2B
- **Short description:** Alibaba's 2B open-weight multimodal edge model of the Qwen3.5 family — image-text-to-text, Apache 2.0, reasoning-capable (thinking mode), targeting on-device/browser inference. Released 2026-02-28.
- **Provider / access:** Open weights on Hugging Face (`Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B`); OpenRouter; DashScope/Model Studio; vLLM/SGLang; WebGPU/on-device demos.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-02-28; knowledge cutoff not publicly stated.
- **IDs:** `Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B` (HF)
- **Context window:** not published on the card API read (family standard 262K for 4B+; this 2B's config not retrieved).
- **Modalities:** text + image + video in; text out; reasoning yes (thinking via chat_template_kwargs); tool calls yes.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Apache 2.0 open weights — free.
- **Architecture:** qwen3_5 vision-language MoE-class dense ~2.27B params (model.safetensors index: 2.27B total).

